sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Server
    participant E as Executor
    C->>H: SendStreamingMessage
    H->>E: execute
    E->>H: StatusUpdate Working
    H-->>C: Task snapshot
    H-->>C: StatusUpdate Working
    E->>H: ArtifactUpdate (chunks)
    H-->>C: ArtifactUpdate (chunks)
    E->>H: StatusUpdate Completed
    H->>H: store the terminal state
    H-->>C: StatusUpdate Completed
